+## What changes
+
+<!-- What a person using Hornhoof Edge gets from this, in plain words. Link the issue: "Closes #123". -->
+
+## How I checked it
+
+<!-- The tests you added, and what you ran. -->
+
+## Checklist
+
+- [ ] The new test failed before the change and passes after it.
+- [ ] `python3 -m unittest discover -s relay/test -v` passes.
+- [ ] ShellCheck passes for each script I changed.
+- [ ] The change contains no private values, and the publication checks pass.
+- [ ] A change to what the relay stores updates the README's list.
+- [ ] All text is in English, with no em dashes.
+- [ ] I reformatted no file I did not change.
+- [ ] Every commit has a `Signed-off-by` line (`git commit -s`).
